--- JSONEachPacketString, data packets follow block boundaries
{"packet":"data","data":"{\"number\":0}\n{\"number\":1}\n"}
{"packet":"data","data":"{\"number\":2}\n"}
--- JSONEachPacketString, totals and extremes
{"packet":"data","data":"0\t2\n1\t2\n"}
{"packet":"totals","data":"\n0\t4\n"}
{"packet":"extremes","data":"\n0\t2\n1\t2\n"}
--- framing makes JSONCompactEachRow emit totals and extremes (dropped in the plain output)
["k", "c"]
["UInt64", "UInt64"]
["0", "2"]
["1", "2"]
data | ["k", "c"]
data | ["UInt64", "UInt64"]
data | ["0", "2"]
data | ["1", "2"]
data | 
totals | 
totals | ["0", "4"]
totals | 
extremes | ["0", "2"]
extremes | ["1", "2"]
extremes | 
--- the concatenation of the payloads is exactly the output of the format
0	2
1	2

0	4

0	2
1	2
--- JSONEachPacketBase64, payload decodes to the JSONEachRow output
{"number":0}
{"number":1}
{"number":2}
--- EventStream
data | 0	2
data | 1	2
data | 
totals | 
totals | 0	4
totals | 
extremes | 
extremes | 0	2
extremes | 1	2
extremes | 
--- EventStream, payload without a trailing newline
data | (0),(1),(2)
--- EventStream reconstructs the payload byte-for-byte, including the trailing newline
byte-exact round trip: OK
--- framing works with HTTP compression
{"number":0}
{"number":1}
{"number":2}
--- EventStream content type
text/event-stream; charset=UTF-8
--- JSONEachPacket content type
application/x-ndjson; charset=UTF-8
--- progress packets are sent
progress packets: OK
--- None framing format works as if no framing is used
{"number":0}
{"number":1}
{"number":2}
--- unknown framing format
Unknown framing format Unknown
--- exception is written as a packet (streaming)
1
--- exception is written as a packet (wait_end_of_query)
1
--- exception is written as a packet (parse error)
1
--- framing is rejected for formats that defer totals and extremes to finalize (Template)
is not compatible with framing formats
--- the deferred-totals rejection is delivered as a framed exception packet
1
--- an exception raised before the output format exists is framed even for Template
1
