SQLInsert payload with a carriage return in the table name round-trips
--- EventStream base64-encodes Pretty and XML (values are written without escaping the carriage return)
text/event-stream; charset=UTF-8; payload=base64
text/event-stream; charset=UTF-8; payload=base64
--- EventStream base64-encodes CustomSeparated with the CSV escaping rule
text/event-stream; charset=UTF-8; payload=base64
--- EventStream base64-encodes CustomSeparated when a delimiter contains a carriage return
text/event-stream; charset=UTF-8; payload=base64
--- EventStream still embeds CustomSeparated with the Escaped rule as plain text
text/event-stream; charset=UTF-8
--- EventStream base64-encodes Markdown only with escape_special_characters (that path passes a carriage return verbatim)
text/event-stream; charset=UTF-8; payload=base64
text/event-stream; charset=UTF-8
